// `libbitrt-x86_64-windows.a` does not exist yet (#3341: tools/build has no
// x86_64-windows target support), so nothing in this file has executed on
// real Windows. `bit check runtime/root/windows` (type-check only) is the
// full verification this ticket could run. The four acceptance scenarios
// (no args / three plain args / a quoted space / an embedded quote), the
// non-ASCII round-trip, and the 0/1/70 exit codes all remain to be run on
// `mustafa-desktop-win` once #3341 lands — #3332's own acceptance criteria
// name this explicitly and it is not claimed done here.
